{"id":"d286b9758fa69367","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CurryInput.md","title":"CurryInput","display":"CurryInput","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"CurryInput","parameters":["g","t","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"CurryInput"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Curry 简单类型算法。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ CurryInput g t a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists w (and (@ Omega w) (and (@ STCtx w g) (and (@ STTy w a) (@ CScope g t)))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c8a973c3d1d5aef\" href=\"?note=1c8a973c3d1d5aef\" title=\"ZFC_CScope\">CScope</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bf7d5deceaf32084\" href=\"?note=bf7d5deceaf32084\" title=\"ZFC_STCtx\">STCtx</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f8de35d9c555d924\" href=\"?note=f8de35d9c555d924\" title=\"ZFC_STTy\">STTy</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","lev